---
import './design-aids.css';
import SketchSheet from './SketchSheet.astro';
---
<figure id="json-structure" class="design-aid design-figure paper-surface json-structure" aria-labelledby="json-structure-title">
  <span class="plate-number">Illustration · Nested values</span>
  <h3 id="json-structure-title">One product row, with structure inside it</h3>
  <p>A possible description for the Blue mug. The packaging measurements and care list sit inside the attributes value.</p>
  <SketchSheet>
    <p class="row-label">products · one row</p>
    <dl class="columns"><div><dt>product_id</dt><dd>P7</dd></div><div><dt>name</dt><dd>Blue mug</dd></div></dl>
    <div class="object">
      <p class="object-label"><code>attributes</code> · JSON object <span aria-hidden="true">{'{'}</span></p>
      <dl class="entries"><div><dt>capacity_ml</dt><dd>350 <small>number</small></dd></div><div><dt>material</dt><dd>"ceramic" <small>string</small></dd></div></dl>
      <div class="nested-values">
        <div class="nested object">
          <p class="object-label"><code>packaging_cm</code> · object <span aria-hidden="true">{'{'}</span></p>
          <dl class="entries"><div><dt>height</dt><dd>12</dd></div><div><dt>width</dt><dd>10</dd></div></dl>
          <p class="closing" aria-hidden="true">{'}'}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="nested array">
          <p class="object-label"><code>care</code> · array <span aria-hidden="true">[</span></p>
          <ol><li>"Wash before use"</li><li>"Hand wash only"</li></ol>
          <p class="closing" aria-hidden="true">]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="closing" aria-hidden="true">{'}'}</p>
    </div>
  </SketchSheet>
  <figcaption>Height is reached through attributes → packaging_cm → height. That path describes nesting inside a value. It does not create separate packaging or care-instruction rows.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .json-structure :global(.sketch-sheet) { margin-top:1.3rem; }
  .row-label { font:.75rem var(--font-mono); color:var(--color-text-secondary); }
  dl { margin:0; }
  dl > div { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:.7rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-rule); padding:.4rem 0; font:.8rem/1.5 var(--font-mono); }
  dt { overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  dd { margin:0; text-align:right; }
  .object { margin-top:1rem; padding:.6rem .8rem; background:var(--paper-match); border-left:1px solid var(--teal); }
  .object-label { font-size:.78rem; color:var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .object-label > span { float:right; font:1.2rem var(--font-mono); }
  .entries small { display:inline-block; font:.7rem var(--font-sans); color:var(--color-text-secondary); margin-left:.3rem; }
  .nested-values { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:1rem; }
  .nested { background:var(--paper-panel); min-width:0; margin-top:1rem; padding:.5rem .7rem; }
  .array { border-left:1px solid var(--gold); }
  .closing { margin:.3rem 0 0 !important; font:1.2rem var(--font-mono); color:var(--color-text-secondary); }
  ol { padding-left:1.3rem; margin:.7rem 0; font:.75rem/1.7 var(--font-mono); }
  li { padding:0 0 .35rem .1rem; }
  @media(max-width:550px) { .nested-values { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:0; } .object { padding:.5rem; } }
</style>
